<title>UK: Croatia sets 300 mln mark seven-year bond.</title>
<headline>Croatia sets 300 mln mark seven-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager CSFB and Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   REPUBLIC OF CROATIA</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DEM   COUPON     6.125     MATURITY    16.JUL.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.709   PAY DATE    16.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.75	REOFFER    99.584    SPREAD	+95 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	BBB-	LISTING    FFURT     PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BAA3	DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/CR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.625</p>
<p> LISTING    0.50</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.75 PCT JULY 2004 BUND</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
